{title: All Hail the Power of Jesus' Name}
{artist: Edward Perronet / Oliver Holden (Coronation)}
{genre: Hymn}
{flow: Opening}
{style: Traditional}
{key: G}
{tempo: 88}
{time: 4/4}
{hymnal: 새찬송가 36장}
{title_ko: 주 예수 이름 높이어}
{score: all-hail-the-power.abc}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[G]All hail the power of [C]Jesus' [G]name
Let [G]angels prostrate [D]fall
Bring [G]forth the royal [C]diadem
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
Bring [G]forth the royal [C]diadem
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[G]Ye chosen seed of [C]Israel's [G]race
Ye [G]ransomed from the [D]fall
Hail [G]Him who saves you [C]by His grace
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
Hail [G]Him who saves you [C]by His grace
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[G]Let every kindred, [C]every [G]tribe
On [G]this terrestrial [D]ball
To [G]Him all majesty [C]ascribe
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
To [G]Him all majesty [C]ascribe
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[G]O that with yonder [C]sacred [G]throng
We [G]at His feet may [D]fall
We'll [G]join the everlasting [C]song
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
We'll [G]join the everlasting [C]song
And [G]crown Him [D]Lord of [G]all
{end_of_verse}
